  "worked_solution": "From the diagram, we have two complementary angles, so\n\n$$\n{54}^{∘}+(10x+{6}^{∘})={90}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nHence, we can solve for $x$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{54}^{∘}+(10x+{6}^{∘}) & ={90}^{∘} \\\\ 10x+{60}^{∘} & ={90}^{∘} \\\\ 10x & ={30}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={3}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
